  "details": "I’d love to see a feature in VRChat that lets us hide specific people from the friend list without fully blocking or unfriending them. Sometimes, I want to avoid interacting with certain friends—like those whose behavior I don’t vibe with—without cutting them off completely. The current mute function stops their voice and actions, but they still show up in the list, which can feel cluttered or stressful. A \"hide from friend list\" option would give us more control over our experience while keeping things peaceful. It’d be a great middle ground between muting and blocking!",
